./codex_run8.log:3434:+Exports are written with a fresh ImageIO metadata dictionary. WatermarkFactory preserves only the source GPS dictionary, then writes `kCGImagePropertyTIFFSoftware` and `kCGImagePropertyIPTCByline` as `automality.com`; these are the standard ImageIO-backed software and IPTC creator/byline fields supported across JPEG, PNG, and TIFF without inventing custom tags. Other source metadata, including embedded comments, camera/software fields, thumbnails, copyright data, and provenance markers, is not copied.
